error[E1254]: cannot tell whether the effect `State Int` is `f`
  --> tests/cirkalang/fail/effect/ambiguous.cirka:10:9
   |
10 | under = get
   |         ^^^
   = note: `f` comes first in the effects `f :: es`: if it is `State Int`, its handler is the one used
   = help: add `Has (State Int) (f :: es)` to the constraints of the signature
error[E1254]: cannot tell whether the effect `State Int` is `f`
  --> tests/cirkalang/fail/effect/ambiguous.cirka:14:9
   |
14 | after = get
   |         ^^^
   = note: `f` comes first in the effects `f :: (State Int :: es)`: if it is `State Int`, its handler is the one used
   = help: add `Has (State Int) (f :: (State Int :: es))` to the constraints of the signature
